{
  "name": "Friends",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You magically emanate a sense of friendship toward one creature you can see within range. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the &amp;Reference[Charmed apply=false] condition for the duration. The target succeeds automatically if it isn’t a Humanoid, if you’re fighting it, or if you have cast this spell on it within the past 24 hours.</p><p>The spell ends early if the target takes damage or if you make an attack roll, deal damage, or force anyone to make a saving throw. When the spell ends, the target knows it was Charmed by you.</p>",
